  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_2922.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(27 fotos) Aquest dimarts ha sigut el dia de la solidaritat dins de la setmana del Centre Cultural Suera, amb recollida de menjar, joguets i llibres per al Serveis Socials de la Mancomunitat Espad&agrave;-Millars i Quisqueya ONG d&#39;Onda, ulleres per a l&#39;ong Youkanyol&eacute;, i tapons de pl&agrave;stic perqu&egrave; el xiquet onder V&iacute;ctor es puga fer la ter&agrave;pia Therasuiet.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_2952.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Despr&eacute;s es va fer a la pla&ccedil;a un mercadet de venda i imntercanvi de tota mena de productes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2917.jpg\" alt=\"img_2917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2919.jpg\" alt=\"img_2919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2922.jpg\" alt=\"img_2922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2923.jpg\" alt=\"img_2923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2924.jpg\" alt=\"img_2924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/solidaritatimercadetsetmanaculturalsuera/img_2925.jpg\" alt=\"img_2925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4